    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Wood, an expert in the intersection of political and religious ideas in the late antique Middle East, chaired a session on Change and Renewal in Non-Muslim Communal Outlooks in the Classical Islamic Period on Thursday 9th July. Concentrating on aspects of adaptation, adjustment, and modification by  non-Muslim communities  in the context of life under Muslim rule, speakers looked at social and administrative change. More information about the session is available here.",
